abstract: >-
  A computer-vision pipeline that estimates elevator cabin
  occupancy from a single CCTV frame and decides whether
  incoming hall calls should be served or bypassed. The
  system combines a YOLOv8 object detector (with a four-class
  scheme covering persons, strollers, luggage, and boxes) and
  a class-based footprint area estimator anchored to
  international elevator-capacity standards.
keywords:
  - computer vision
  - YOLOv8
  - object detection
  - elevator control
  - energy efficiency
  - smart buildings
  - occupancy estimation
